# Documented Trivy exceptions. Currently: NONE.
#
# Every entry needs, directly above it, a comment with
#   - affected image and package,
#   - why it is not exploitable here or why no fix is available,
#   - the reviewer who approved it (PR link),
# and an expiry date so it is re-evaluated, e.g.:
#
#   # thesishounds/ollama: libfoo in upstream ollama/ollama base, no fixed release yet.
#   # Not reachable: inference network is internal. Approved in PR #123.
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2027-01-31
#
# Blanket rules (whole severities, packages or images) are not allowed.
